WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.320
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:09.260
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.830
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.770
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.790
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.230
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:31.000
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.280
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:38.720
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.310
it waits nearby.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:49.770
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:49.840
I can say love

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.570
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.990 --> 00:00:53.570
will you love me?

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:57.180
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.250 --> 00:01:00.130
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:03.690
The shape of your love,

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:08.340
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:29.100
Gravity disturbance from a ship coming out of jump detected ahead!

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:33.100
Judging from its energy signature, it's definitely a GP cargo ship!

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.200
Excellent. Prepare to capture it.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.210
Attention, GP cargo ship!

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:40.840
...Stop and prepare to be...! 
Oh, Ryoko-san! It's good to see you again!

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:43.010
Good to see you again!

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:44.780
Seina Yamada?!

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:46.680
Gravity disturbances behind us!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.840
Hey now! That prey belongs to me!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.920
They've come to get us!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.320
It's a decoy ship!

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.460
Get us out of here!

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:59.660
Emergency jump!

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:04.030
Outta the way!

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:05.900
Ours was the only ship to run away.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:08.700
Most likely all the other ships will be...

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:12.040
Coordinates 1802!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:15.060
There's a ship coming out of jump right behind us!

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.210
Judging from its energy output, it's prey!

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:20.110
OK! This time for sure...!

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.480
Oh, Ryoko-san!

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:25.650
It's a great pleasure to see you again!

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:28.310
Large number of gravity disturbances behind us!

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:31.690
Escape!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.390
Another prey!

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:34.660
Oh, Ryoko-san!

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:36.500
Escape...

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:38.300
...Prey! ...Oh, Ryoko-san!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.900
Escape...

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.000
Oh, Ryoko-san!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.660
Escape...

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:47.510
Sorry, we seem to meet a lot...

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:49.530
We sure do!

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:54.010
Why?! Why is he wherever we go?!

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:57.020
I put so much work into finding out why, but...!

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:01.090
I'm choosing sectors that he will absolutely not be in...!

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.420
I'm really sorry...

00:03:02.420 --> 00:03:04.280
Ryoko-san!

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:10.290
First Paycheck and Presents

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:16.130
The damage from Lorelei Seina is no longer something we can ignore.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:20.400
We have a number of different solutions, but none seems to be effective...

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.800
What are you doing about the Seina situation, Tarant-dono?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.910
I had no idea there was someone like that on Earth.

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:30.710
Meaning you failed with your special hostage-taking plan.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.850
Although risky, perhaps we should deal with Seina Yamada directly?

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.020
This is the academy we're up against!

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:39.290
Doesn't anyone have a plan?!

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.340
Ryoko Balouta-sama.

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:46.530
She's already popular among many of the GP members.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.860
She could use that fact to get near Seina.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:49.730
That's cowardly!

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:52.030
Making others carry out your own schemes...!

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:56.870
Why is it that her ship can run into Seina but still makes it home just fine?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.040
What proof do you have that she's a spy?!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.560
Do you have any saying that she isn't?

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:05.710
So I need to prove where my loyalties lie?

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.610
You have a trump card, do you not, Ryoko-sama?

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.720
A trump card called Elma.

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:14.950
That is not information you're supposed to know!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.350
That's enough!

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:20.530
What do you say, Ryoko Balouta?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:23.590
Let's let Elma do it.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.330
I look forward to the results.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.460
Yes! Commander Da Ruma!

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:34.470
Are you sure about this?

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:37.140
Pirates don't go assassinating people!

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:42.010
We can't contact the crew's family...

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.350
That spineless Tarant...!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:50.960
Gathering of all escape pods complete.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:53.030
All pirates have been arrested!

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:54.790
Take us out of Level 1 emergency alert.

00:04:54.790 --> 00:04:56.030
Roger.

00:04:56.030 --> 00:04:57.830
Looks like we made it out OK...

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:03.440
It's too early to tell, but at least we won't run into any warships.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.040
Because Tarant showed up already?

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.270
Sweet!

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:08.310
They increased our pay by a lot!

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.280
Captain Seina's awesome!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.580
Alright! The minute we get back it's celebratin' time!

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.950
Yay!

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:16.650
Oh! Our pay really has been transferred!

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:17.280
Now I can...

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.920
Hey, wait!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.750
They didn't give me anything!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.660
Well, duh! You're just the captain's equipment, you know!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:25.720
What did you say?!

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:31.460
You have no idea how much work I've done for the GP! Morons!

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:33.130
Seina-san...

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:34.330
Yeah, alright...

00:05:34.330 --> 00:05:37.630
I want some new memory banks...

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:41.910
No way. You'll just use it for more hidden camera videos...

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:45.780
Well, I also know that you...

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:50.620
I-it's nothing...

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.250
So will you?

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.150
Fine. But this is the only time.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:56.520
And...

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.730
I'd like the latest version of this!

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.030
W-what are you going to use that for?!

00:06:06.030 --> 00:06:09.640
Geez, what a kid. It's so obvious.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:13.910
With this you can peek anywhere you want, and it even bends!

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:15.410
I can see everything with it!

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:17.940
Amane-san and Kiriko-san changing their clothes too, of course!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.750
I peek, get close-up pictures, and then store them in my memory banks!

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:25.020
I've been wanting to do this for a while, and now I have a good reason!

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:29.110
...Ow, that hurts... ...Return us to port! ...Roger!

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.460
That reminds me, have you heard about Seiryo?

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:34.460
No...

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:36.600
His family's been trying to haggle the ransom money down,

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.030
so it doesn't look like he's coming back any time soon!

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:42.230
Tennan-sensei's family... is rich, right?

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:44.700
His dad's famous for his stubbornness...

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:47.270
It would be nice if he came back, though...

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:49.580
How disgraceful!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:53.450
To think that I have to be content being with a bunch of filthy pirates...

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:57.640
Seina Yamada could never stand being in an environment such as this.

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:02.250
Tarant-sama. The plan went smoothly, didn't it?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.260
Is everything ready for Ryoko's escape?

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:09.490
Yes. All that's left is to pray that nothing unexpected happens.

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:14.370
Things would be really difficult if the commander knew about this.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.170
What if she betrays us?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:20.430
We'll just have to get someone to watch her.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:24.800
Dirty pirates... Still no food?

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:38.660
And where are you going?

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.160
Eep!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.230
Shopping?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:42.930
If so, then let me come with...

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:44.500
Wouldn't you rather go drinking?

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:46.800
Amane! Seina-chan is still underage!

00:07:46.800 --> 00:07:49.370
I'm sorry! I made a promise to a friend!

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.170
Seina-chan...?

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.210
That jerk! Turning down a beautiful girl's invitation like that...!

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:54.870
Let's go after him!

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:04.670
NB's map says it should be around here somewhere...

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.820
Aren't you underage?

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:10.790
It's not good to get into this stuff at such a young age...

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.790
I am terribly sorry!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:16.400
I didn't see that you were a captain! I will bring the files at once!

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:19.030
O-okay...

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:20.430
Just to be expected of a captain!

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:24.470
You've chosen quite a good hobby, Captain! Leave the rest of this area to me!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.070
Um, isn't this a police station?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:28.110
Certainly! Which is why you can have all these files!

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.100
I don't need this many...

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:33.450
Yamada-sama, correct?

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.010
Y-yes...

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:39.510
I'll go get the item NB-sama ordered, so please wait one moment.

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:45.150
NB sure knows a lot about these kinds of stores...

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:49.800
I never expected to see Seina-chan coming to this kind of shop...!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:53.370
...If he would just ask, I'd give him my underwear anytime he wanted... ...You can't do that!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:56.340
Don't worry, I'd wash them first.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.140
That's not what I meant!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:00.840
May I help you?

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.640
What do you think of the clothes?

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:05.010
Uh...

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:06.450
What do you think?

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:08.710
We'll... take them...

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.180
Let's see, the next one is...

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.670
Alright! A toy store!

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.360
Oh no! He's going in there?!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.030
What's the problem? Isn't it just a toyshop?

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.120
Why don't you go see for yourself?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.320
Excuse me...

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:37.110
I told you. They're toys, but a different kind of toys.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:43.120
...Seina-chan's...! ...To think that Seina would use things like that...

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:45.650
Why do I have to do buy all this weird stuff?

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.950
And what is this place?

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:52.660
U-um...

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:55.330
Our store is for members only.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.260
Who introduced you?

00:09:57.260 --> 00:09:58.590
NB...

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:07.370
NB-sensei introduced you?! Please forgive my rudeness!

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:09.500
Come right this way!

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:14.680
...Hurry! ...No, I'm...!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:17.620
No way! Seina-chan would never...!

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:20.350
Do Earthlings do that sort of thing from a young age?!

00:10:20.350 --> 00:10:22.420
This has to be some sort of dream!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:24.190
That's right, a dream.

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.560
Yes?

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.560
This is a place where you can enjoy yourself as you live out your dreams...

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.830
Let's all enjoy ourselves together...

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.630
U-um...!

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:36.240
You're...!

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:39.900
We'll show you the finest of dreams...

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:43.440
No, no, we're normal!

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.540
We're not into that sort of thing!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.910
That's what they all say at first...

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:52.040
...We don't want to! ...Don't be so shy...

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:55.680
Yet another weird thing I bought...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.860
Geez...

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.690
What exactly does he do when I'm not watching?

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:04.460
Seina-kun!

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:07.330
E-Elma-san!

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.480
Today is payday, isn't it?

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:23.720
Yeah...

00:11:23.720 --> 00:11:25.750
Presents for your girlfriend?

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.390
N-no!

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:28.920
A friend asked me to buy these...

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:33.830
If you're wondering what to buy, I'll show you some really good shops!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.160
Really?!

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:42.030
I didn't know that was your specialty...

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:44.040
It isn't a specialty!

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.510
It was GP capture training put to practical use!

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.130
Damn, where did Seina run off to?!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.980
He turned down my invitation for her...?!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.850
Oh my god! Don't tell me that stuff was for Elma!

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:59.750
He won't get away with this!

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:03.160
As for what would make a girl happy...

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.930
Woman is probably more appropriate than girl...

00:12:06.930 --> 00:12:08.930
So she's older than you?

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:11.060
A friend asked me to...

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:13.930
Well, I'll just leave it at that.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:16.830
Seina-kun. Let's use a teleport pod!

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.340
That dirty Elma! Trying to run away from me...!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.950
How dare she mock a 1st class detective!

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.810
You're still a 2nd class detective.

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:31.280
This is no time for technicalities!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:33.720
So there's a place like this!

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:36.150
If you're not fussy about brands, this place is for you!

00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.890
There are things that top designers made for fun,

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:40.830
so it's nothing to be looked at lightly.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.360
Thank you!

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:47.700
But with so many stores, I might have trouble choosing which to shop at!

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:49.730
Yeah...

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.430
She's not at the stuffed animal age...

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:02.380
Look! This is good!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.180
I'm not really buying for myself...

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.080
It looks good on you!

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:12.820
It's true...

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.430
Oh, Seina-kun!

00:13:14.430 --> 00:13:16.830
And Elma!

00:13:16.830 --> 00:13:17.730
Airi-san...

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.400
Are you here shopping?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:22.600
That's right. Just stocking up for the shop...

00:13:22.600 --> 00:13:26.340
But never mind me, don't tell me that the two of you are...

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:31.010
Seina-kun is buying presents for his girlfriend and I'm helping him choose.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:32.810
A friend asked me to...

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:33.980
And then...

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:36.280
Oh, your girlfriend, huh?

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:39.220
I'd like... this!

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.550
I'll be waiting for you tonight!

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:42.650
Later!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.960
Tonight...?

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.030
That's Airi-sama for you!

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:51.700
But accessories are a safe bet when it comes to getting a girl a present!

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.170
You might be right!

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:54.330
I am!

00:13:57.970 --> 00:14:00.570
Elma-san! This way!

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.840
Not so fast, Seina-kun!

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:07.510
This is so pretty!

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:09.080
It really is!

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:12.850
I hardly ever buy accessories, but this one I...

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.960
But what I want doesn't matter, we need to finish your shopping!

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.190
Sorry about that!

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:23.180
No, I'm learning a lot from you!

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.470
Elma-sama...

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:39.010
So you're monitoring me?

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.810
You think I'll betray you?

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:45.340
We are merely here to report what happens.

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:50.290
We pray for your success.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.860
Elma-san! Is something the matter?

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:53.360
Eh?

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.060
Are you all right, Elma-san?

00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:56.700
I-I'm just fine!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.060
Why don't we go take a break somewhere?

00:14:59.060 --> 00:15:02.160
R-right! Let's go!

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:08.570
Freedom won't come to me, therefore I must go to it.

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:10.940
1 step in 1 day, 3 steps in 3 days.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.380
3 steps forward, and then 5 steps back.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:17.420
Wait, doesn't that mean I'll never move forward...?

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:20.390
This isn't the time for such questions!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.850
Breaking oneself out without resorting to paying the ransom

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.290
is the manly way of doing things!

00:15:35.370 --> 00:15:39.000
My spectacular escape from imprisonment has been a success.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.130
Next I need to acquire a weapon...

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:42.700
OK!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:46.780
This is also due to my heroic actions!

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:50.050
I'm amazing!

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.380
Not suspecting a thing is what's amazing.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:55.980
...I'm so cool! ...Just cause a big uproar.

00:15:56.490 --> 00:15:58.260
Are you feeling OK?

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.620
...I'm fine. ...That's good.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.260
Have some if you'd like!

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.170
I don't want any.

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:09.070
O-oh...

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:14.240
Um, I've decided what to buy, so I'll be back in a little bit!

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.970
Have fun.

00:16:15.970 --> 00:16:17.700
OK, I'll be back!

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:29.720
Where's the exit?!

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:36.700
Who is he?

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:40.270
Kyo Komachi caught him. He's the son of the Tennan family.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:43.240
Oh, so he's a Tennan...?

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:45.770
He's not bad at all...

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.140
Please excuse me!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:52.340
I see.

00:16:52.340 --> 00:16:53.350
Tarant!

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:59.890
The families of the crew you were using to blackmail Ryoko Balouta have escaped.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:00.950
What?!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.060
Did you assume we didn't know?

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.730
Don't worry! We won't reprimand you.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:10.630
But they took the Original J with them.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.400
Get it back. No matter what it takes.

00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:14.490
Yes, sir!

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.040
I know! But...!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.440
Elma-san!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.580
I'm sorry for taking so long!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:28.280
Various things happened and I got lost!

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:30.950
Seina-kun. Those presents...

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.290
Who are they for?

00:17:33.290 --> 00:17:36.080
Uh, well...

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.760
Tell me.

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.780
I'll deliver them for you.

00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:53.970
The bad luck boy who was traumatized when Tarant tried to kill him...

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:58.140
You should have listened to Kiriko's warning and gone back home...

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:02.680
Why...?

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:07.390
I had fun living with you and the others!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:11.920
If possible, I would have liked things to stay like that forever...

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:13.080
Really!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:21.770
But... I'm sorry!

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:28.310
I thought that when I got my first paycheck...

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:31.340
I would get presents to thank the various people I'm indebted to...

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.010
For me... too...?

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:46.050
If you were an ordinary GP officer, this wouldn't be so...

00:18:47.330 --> 00:18:48.590
Elma-san!

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:58.330
E-Elma-san...

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:07.850
N-no way...

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:10.680
Ryoko-san...?

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.350
Really...

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:15.550
Together... forever...

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.790
But...!

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:22.160
I can't abandon the families of my crew!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.760
Seina-kun. Return to Earth.

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.870
Ryoko-san!

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.390
Goodbye...

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:36.330
...Ryoko-san! ...I've found you now, Seina!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.100
No!

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.220
...Damn her! ...We better!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:57.960
Seina!

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:00.130
What do you think you're doing, going on a date with Elma?!

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:01.660
Explain this very instant...!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.700
That was a good scene, but it was a botched ending.

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.440
A-Airi-san...

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.430
How...?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:19.680
Airi-sama... You knew Ryoko was Elma?

00:20:19.680 --> 00:20:20.950
I sure did.

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:24.190
In order to discover the pirates' spy infiltration routes into the GP,

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:27.130
we let Elma remain at large.

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.660
Ryoko-san.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.230
I heard they found your crew's families alive and safe.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:34.100
Isn't that great?!

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.970
U-um...

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:39.940
I didn't get to give this to you earlier...

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:41.840
T-that's...?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.110
...your present, Ryoko-san.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:49.210
After all, I have troubled you a lot...

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:57.380
Thank you...

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.130
What's going to happen to her?

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:08.330
Well, the circumstances being what they are,

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.240
I'm sure a lot of her fans will probably petition to get her out,

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:12.140
so I think she'll be just fine.

00:21:12.140 --> 00:21:13.470
That's good...

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:17.080
More importantly, you gave a present to Ryoko-chan earlier, right?

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.010
Y-yeah...

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:20.040
What about mine?

00:21:20.040 --> 00:21:23.210
Eh?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:26.310
You'll give something to Ryoko but not to me?

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:28.950
Um...

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.690
Of course I have some!

00:21:31.690 --> 00:21:32.690
I have one for Amane-san...

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:33.790
One for Kiriko-san...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.490
And one for Airi-san too...

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:37.360
Let's see... I'm sure they're around here somewhere...

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:39.860
Where are our presents?!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.730
The police car came flying out of nowhere and then...

00:21:41.730 --> 00:21:43.900
Where are our presents?!

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.300
I really bought some!

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:46.170
Give 'em to us!

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.170
My stuff!

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.210
It's the truth!

00:21:48.210 --> 00:21:52.040
I was gonna use it to check out Amane-san, Kiriko-san, and Airi-san even though she's kind of an old lady...

00:21:52.040 --> 00:21:56.080
But I was gonna use that stuff to spy on them more than ever before!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.650
Hey now!

00:21:57.650 --> 00:21:59.420
What were you going to do to us?!

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:00.720
I'm a what?!

00:22:00.720 --> 00:22:03.720
All of Seina-chan's shopping was for that...?!

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:05.020
What?

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:09.260
Ow...! Stop...! I didn't do it, though!

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.740
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.740
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.860
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:26.860
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.070
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:34.070
No matter what you do,

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.800
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:35.090 --> 00:22:36.800
no matter what you do,

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.590
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:41.590
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.880
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:43.880
that come your way.

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.450
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.680 --> 00:22:47.450
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.160
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.160
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:56.390
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.420 --> 00:22:56.390
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.860
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.390 --> 00:23:00.860
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.810
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.710 --> 00:23:10.810
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:15.430
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:15.430
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.510
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:20.510
But all I can see is you,

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.030
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:26.030
just the way you are.

00:23:31.020 --> 00:23:34.460
We rescued a lifeboat that was all beaten up.

00:23:34.460 --> 00:23:37.030
A man inside it gave us a small box.

00:23:37.030 --> 00:23:38.500
Deliver it to Seto-sama?

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:41.630
Pirates after the box start attacking the Kamidake!

00:23:41.630 --> 00:23:43.800
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!

00:23:43.800 --> 00:23:44.900
Kamidake Seriously Damaged
